      "origin": "unused-tools",
      "status": "not_affected",
      "justification": "vulnerable_code_not_in_execute_path",
      "impactStatement": "The fixed, non-root vllm serve commands do not perform APT package acquisition. Model downloads and wheel hash verification/extraction run in the separate gateway init image. The upstream serving image is read-only and cannot install system packages; the advisory requires APT acquisition/redirect/retry operations. APT remains vulnerable for other uses.",
