      "justification": "vulnerable_code_not_in_execute_path",
      "impactStatement": "The reviewed commands serve pinned local safetensors, text and uploaded audio; they do not invoke GnuPG or parse ASCII-armored OpenPGP messages. Setup uses the separate gateway image and does not execute GnuPG in this image. The affected armor parser remains vulnerable for other uses.",
